# Allowlist form (protoLabs workspace-config standard): ignore everything,
# then re-include the committed source-of-truth files. New volatile files br
# adds (beads.db*, *.lock, .br_history/, last-touched, metadata.json, *.tmp)
# are ignored automatically with no .gitignore churn.
*
!issues.jsonl
!config.yaml
!routes.jsonl
!.gitignore
